# Integration rules

- The Integration Lead protects `main`.
- Keep `main` runnable.
- API contract changes require team coordination.
- Verify frontend/backend compatibility before merging.
- Avoid architecture rewrites during hackathon hours.
- Keep environment variables documented.
- Do not place secrets in deployment configuration.
- Reject unnecessary scope expansion.
- Near demo time, prioritize bug fixes over new features.
